WEBVTT

00:01:28.918 --> 00:01:30.086
thank you --

00:01:30.753 --> 00:01:34.257
also triggered my healing journey

00:01:34.257 --> 00:01:38.761
in embracing my reality
as a person living with disability.

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:46.227
Worldwide, one in seven people
has a disability.

00:01:47.687 --> 00:01:52.066
Disability is a reality
that affects us all.

00:01:52.942 --> 00:01:55.820
It's part of the diversity
of human experience.

00:01:56.154 --> 00:01:57.947
We may be born with it,

00:01:57.989 --> 00:02:01.325
acquire it through an accident or aging,